{"id":"6fc24b4011f16912","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-1-consistency.md","title":"1-Consistency","display":"df-1-consistency — 1-Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-1-consistency","aliases":["92-df-1-consistency"],"display":"df-1-consistency — 1-Consistency","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 60–63（PDF 77–80）为相关主题；1-相容名称采用本地 Σ1 可靠性约定","source_status":"本地术语约定"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-1-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-1-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-1-consistency — 1-Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 60–63（PDF 77–80）为相关主题；1-相容名称采用本地 Σ1 可靠性约定"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地术语约定"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> (metatheoretic provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (Sigma-1 formula class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (external truth predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Sigma_1^G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\sigma)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Sigma_1^G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\sigma)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的1一致性</li>\n<li>这里的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性就是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>-可靠性，而不是对所有算术句子的完全可靠性</li>\n<li>它只要求<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句在标准算术中为真</li>\n<li>对能够逐个验证真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>事实的通常算术理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性蕴含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性，而<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性蕴含普通一致性；这些背景强度条件不能对任意形式系统省略</li>\n<li>定义使用元语言关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\sigma\">\\(G\\vdash\\sigma\\)</span>；内部谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span>只能接收句子编码的数项</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本文明定 1-Con 为 Σ₁ 可靠性。原书相应论证主要使用 ω-相容性及 Σ₀ 正确判定，并没有在这些页把本地这个谓词作为统一定义。对原书无指数弱系统，真实 Σ₁ 可证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"908bea5b0f15b61b\" href=\"?note=908bea5b0f15b61b\" title=\"92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness\">92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness</a>；这与“所有已证 Σ₁ 都真”方向相反。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\vdash\\varphi$ (metatheoretic provability relation, see [[92-df-provable]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^G$ (Sigma-1 formula class, see [[92-df-sigma1-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G$ (external truth predicate, see [[92-df-arithmetic-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"908bea5b0f15b61b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本文明定 1-Con 为 Σ₁ 可靠性。原书相应论证主要使用 ω-相容性及 Σ₀ 正确判定，并没有在这些页把本地这个谓词作为统一定义。对原书无指数弱系统，真实 Σ₁ 可证见 [[92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness]]；这与“所有已证 Σ₁ 都真”方向相反。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Sigma_1^G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\sigma)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G","display":false}],"bytes":1911,"backlinks":[{"id":"28f4d899d4e85281","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (1-consistency predicate, see [[92-df-1-consistency]])"},{"id":"8086f2be7f666ab6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Con}$ (consistency predicates, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]], [[92-df-1-consistency]], [[92-df-consistent]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["51c43e0240787ebb","8fd1dce21b2c65db","482ac6c3f68b4b5b","90f32e29c9d553ed","908bea5b0f15b61b"]}